{"channelId":"UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","row":["Northern Lights Wildlife Shelter (NLWS)",1160,"Northern Lights Wildlife Society is located in Smithers, BC, Canada and rehabilitates injured and/or orphaned wildlife until it can be returned to the wild. We rewild all native mammals and act as a triage center for birds. We specialize in bears (both black bears and grizzly) and other large mammals. NLWS is primarily operated by volunteers and is not open to public viewing.  We are funded by public donations and licenced by the BC Government since 1990.","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:15.312Z","channelId":"UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"085605c0ba145fcadd90e9456a899325da5336104b582357382a68d7b61d91c0","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fb08d40725f16def3f5d14a27cdc8f01d92301dd2740439fb78fbb9af6bbe9cd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:15.312Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1160,"raw":"1.16K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrb8X9hGVXdzGOqwbIITVXA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:15.312Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Northern Lights Wildlife Society is located in Smithers, BC, Canada and rehabilitates injured and/or orphaned wildlife until it can be ret